---
const coreValues = [
  { icon: '◆', title: '诚信为本', desc: '以诚信立企，以信誉铸魂，构建值得信赖的商业伙伴关系' },
  { icon: '★', title: '专业立身', desc: '深耕行业领域，以专业能力赢得市场尊重与客户认可' },
  { icon: '▲', title: '创新驱动', desc: '拥抱前沿科技，以创新思维推动业务模式持续升级' },
  { icon: '●', title: '价值创造', desc: '聚焦价值创造，为股东、客户、员工和社会创造持续回报' },
];
---

<section id="overview" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-surface-50 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16 scroll-reveal">
      <span class="text-primary-500 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 block">ABOUT HONGBANG</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-surface-900">关于宏邦</h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-primary-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Brief intro -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 scroll-reveal">
      <p class="text-surface-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        宏邦集团（湖北宏邦商务服务有限公司）成立于2023年10月，注册资本5000万元，是一家以科技创新为引擎、产业协同为纽带、价值创造为目标的综合性企业集团。
      </p>
      <p class="text-surface-600 leading-relaxed">
        集团立足武汉，辐射全国，在苏州、杭州设有分支机构，旗下拥有6家子公司，业务涵盖科技与AI、贸易与供应链、投资与资产管理三大板块。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core values -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        {coreValues.map((val, i) => (
          <div class="group p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-200/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary-200 transition-all duration-300 text-center hover:-translate-y-1">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-500 text-2xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              {val.icon}
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-surface-900">{val.title}</h4>
            <p class="text-surface-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{val.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Learn more link -->
    <div class="text-center mt-12 scroll-reveal">
      <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary-500 text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
        了解更多
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
